and hear this cowboy band

00:04:30.436 --> 00:04:31.337 size:81% position:41% line:92%
until two weeks later.

00:04:31.337 --> 00:04:34.841
So for two weeks, he thought
he'd been completely iced.

00:04:34.841 --> 00:04:37.777 align:start size:94% position:6%
But then, I finally heard it
-Yeah.

00:04:37.777 --> 00:04:40.146 align:start size:94% position:6%
