You know?

00:05:46.913 --> 00:05:49.649 align:start size:94% position:6%
They don't know.
-This is fascinating to me

00:05:49.649 --> 00:05:51.918 align:start size:94% position:6%
Megan, you found --
Because you say that,

00:05:51.918 --> 00:05:55.688
and I think that's true, but you
actually found old letters of --

00:05:55.688 --> 00:05:57.657 align:start size:94% position:6%
