00:06:50.343 --> 00:06:51.577 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-That's fascinating.

00:06:51.577 --> 00:06:54.480 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's kind of unbelievable
-It's crazy.

00:06:54.480 --> 00:06:59.452 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it's pretty also
embarrassing for us in that --

00:06:59.452 --> 00:07:01.187 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because this is before,
obviously, texting,

00:07:01.187 --> 00:07:05.458
